Feature: Student Model Postgres Store — reads
  As the study-tutor backend
  I want the learner snapshot, per-topic confidences, and recent misconceptions read from the study-tutor-owned Postgres store
  So that the planner and handlers see real learner state through the same graceful-degradation contract the retired Graphiti read path guaranteed

  Background:
    Given a study-tutor Postgres store with the FEAT-SMP-001 schema applied

