  @key-example @smoke @read-path
  Scenario: Reading the snapshot for a known learner returns her profile, confidences, and recent misconceptions
    Given Lilymay exists with a target grade and year group
    And she has recorded confidence on "Macbeth Act 1" and a recent misconception on it
    When her learner snapshot is read
    Then the snapshot should report her as a known learner
    And it should include her target grade and year group
    And it should include her per-topic confidence for "Macbeth Act 1"
    And it should include her recent misconception on "Macbeth Act 1"

  # Why: The planner's confidence inputs — one entry per topic carrying its derived band
  @task:TASK-SMP2-01
  @key-example @read-path
  Scenario: Reading per-topic confidences returns one entry per topic carrying its band
    Given Lilymay has resolved confidence of 72 percent on "Macbeth Act 1" and 45 percent on "Metaphor"
    When her per-topic confidences are read
    Then there should be one confidence entry per topic
    And "Macbeth Act 1" should carry the band "secure"
    And "Metaphor" should carry the band "developing"

