  @key-example @smoke @planner-repoint
  Scenario: The session planner receives store-backed confidences and misconceptions for a seeded learner
    Given Lilymay has store-recorded confidences and a recent misconception
    When a session is planned for her
    Then the planner should receive her confidences and recent misconceptions
    And the planner should treat her learner state as available

